  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[webdriverio](https://www.npmjs.com/package/webdriverio) just published its new version 4.2.6.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :rotating_light:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      webdriverio\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      4.2.6\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build went from success to failure**.\n\nAs webdriverio is “only” a devDependency of this project it **might not break production or downstream projects**, but “only” your build or test tools – **preventing new deploys or publishes**.\n\nI recommend you give this issue a high priority. I’m sure you can resolve this :muscle:\n\nOf course this could just be a false positive, caused by a flaky test suite, or third parties that are currently broken or unavailable, but that would be another problem I’d recommend working on.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 96 commits .\n- [`c4b3735`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/c4b37354819f01f39dbd8ce447e450c1c8a5f4f9) <code>v4.2.6</code>\n- [`d027d1d`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/d027d1d921d3ff30dffed943928875da7076e8fb) <code>Update contributors</code>\n- [`54eed2c`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/54eed2ce6fdb62208d78c28003b793ff09c9de61) <code>updated changelog</code>\n- [`c6c46de`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/c6c46de5ce5bc08922db78e7c8dcdc3799aa3674) <code>Merge pull request #1542 from paazmaya/1541-limit-files-npm-package</code>\n- [`f29791a`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/f29791af57509eed774b8be0c635de6d113c6ff5) <code>Remove lib and index.js from files list</code>\n- [`5aa4d9c`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/5aa4d9c5dae72663d768c899f55beea781cf56d4) <code>Add files list to limit :pig: getting to npm</code>\n- [`7ad746f`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/7ad746fcb287f51f23ba2ca447efd1cf899b6da3) <code>Merge pull request #1537 from lisss/screenshot-event</code>\n- [`0d2f3a8`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/0d2f3a809a4bf1800835cfc8987a6aa86eb31f85) <code>Add 'screenshot' internal event to list of internal events</code>\n- [`0b08a87`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/0b08a8796b64788709cacdf3d256716161f2e06a) <code>v4.2.5</code>\n- [`74363ca`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/74363ca69e0fb7356bf218ae3343a72d1c4f8d9e) <code>updated changelog</code>\n- [`009b456`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/009b45619a8cdbec3fc2941d6af4945bfdeb7503) <code>allow spec arg - closes #1533</code>\n- [`8c5ff0f`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/8c5ff0f05745cdd2fafbf82e0343f0b74ecd24ff) <code>v4.2.4</code>\n- [`95fafb3`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/95fafb31eea89aaff2c701a8db07642f2e6fc2a8) <code>Update contributors</code>\n- [`a6469c9`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/a6469c91efaa9bee1dd831a959c8b4e700f61e6b) <code>updated changelog [ci skip]</code>\n- [`8bd07dd`](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/commit/8bd07dd07d2701052395cd75ce8bb0e37cab3fd1) <code>improved id regex - closes #1494</code>\n\nThere are 96 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/compare/9c24915faaff9e0b9ce75bbfcbcbee9bf0d8f349...c4b37354819f01f39dbd8ce447e450c1c8a5f4f9).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
